{"content":[{"c":["HANANEL, Tower of"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Tower on the north wall of Jerusalem, located near the Sheep Gate (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.1","r":"Neh.3.1","rawR":"Neh.3.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.1","value":"Neh.3.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:1"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.12.39","r":"Neh.12.39","rawR":"Neh.12.39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.12.39","value":"Neh.12.39"}],"t":"ref","v":"12:39"},"; ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Hananeel”). Later in Israel’s history John Hyrcanus erected a Maccabean fortress on this spot, which Pompey destroyed in 63 ",{"c":["BC"],"sourceClass":"era","t":"span"},". Still later, Herod the Great built the Tower of Antonia here to oversee the temple area. Two prophecies refer to the Tower of Hananel as a boundary point in the rebuilding of Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.31.38","r":"Jer.31.38","rawR":"Jer.31.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.31.38","value":"Jer.31.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 31:38"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Zech.14.10","r":"Zech.14.10","rawR":"Zech.14.10","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zech.14.10","value":"Zech.14.10"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zec 14:10"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"HananelTowerof","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Neh 3:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.1","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.1","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.1"},{"anchorText":"12:39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.12.39","rawQueryValue":"Neh.12.39","sourceRefExact":"Neh.12.39"},{"anchorText":"Jer 31:38","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.31.38","rawQueryValue":"Jer.31.38","sourceRefExact":"Jer.31.38"},{"anchorText":"Zec 14:10","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zech.14.10","rawQueryValue":"Zech.14.10","sourceRefExact":"Zech.14.10"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"40dc910cef8269f1c29727612b9e9d926e775fe9530588a2eadb0227ba9ce505","sourceItemName":"HananelTowerof","sourceItemOrder":84,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"HananelTowerof","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Hananel, Tower of","title":"Hananel, Tower of","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}